          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te avisamos 3 días antes de la renovación preguntándote si aún usas el servicio. Tú decides, nosotros te ayudamos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ti mostreremo cosa potresti fare con quei soldi: viaggi, cene, esperienze. Ne vale davvero la pena?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We'll show you what you could do with that money: travel, dinners, experiences. Is it really worth it?"
